  13. A person who divulges or misappropriates confidential information, in violation of Article 118 (1).
  (2) Any of the following persons shall be punished by imprisonment with labor for up to one year, or by a fine of up to five million won: <Amended on Dec. 21, 2007; Dec. 29, 2009; Jun. 15, 2011; Dec. 18, 2012; Dec. 27, 2016; Oct. 24, 2023>
